<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Page not found · Vyaasa</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        background: #f8f9fa;
        font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        color: #212529;
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }
      .wrap { text-align: center; max-width: 26rem; }
      .code { font-size: 4.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #FF8B00; margin: 0; line-height: 1; }
      h1 { margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; }
      p { margin: 0; color: #6c757d; }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
        background: #FF8B00;
        color: #fff;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 0.25rem;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="code">404</p>
      <h1>Page not found</h1>
      <p>The page you're looking for doesn't exist or may have been moved.</p>
      <a href="/" class="btn">Back to home</a>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
